  <hr class="my-8" />

  <div dir="ltr" lang="en" class="text-left">
    <h2>Oscar Drive — Privacy Policy (English)</h2>
    <p>Last updated: November 5, 2026 · App: Oscar Drive (com.oscardevs.oscardrive) · Developer: OscarDevs</p>
    <p><strong>No account, no ads.</strong> Your location is processed on the device to show speed, heading and trips and to warn you
      before places you saved. It is <strong>not sent anywhere</strong> unless you turn on «Security &amp; tracking» yourself.</p>
    <p><strong>Security &amp; tracking (optional, off by default):</strong> the screen records the car's location (every 10 s moving, every minute parked)
      and security events, and uploads them to OscarDevs (drive.oscardevs.com) when a connection is available, so the phones you paired with a
      one-time code can see them and receive alerts. With it goes a car summary for the phone page — the last 10 parking spots (place, time,
      accuracy, note), the odometer, maintenance status, the last 10 refuels and consumption, and a 6-month summary; it is sent only when it
      changes and the server keeps only the latest copy. Locations are deleted after 30 days, events after 180 days. Not sold or shared.
      <strong>Camera (optional):</strong> records video without audio on a theft alert or on request; the video stays on the screen and only its time and length are uploaded.</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Stored on your device only:</strong> trips, speeding log, saved hazards/places/parking spots, car odometer, maintenance and fuel entries,
        settings and an optional emergency contact. Uninstalling the app or clearing its data deletes all of it; we cannot access or restore it.</li>
      <li><strong>Permissions:</strong> location (speed, heading, trips, alerts — used while the app runs with a visible notification), notifications,
        start on boot (optional), internet (faster GPS fix; in-app navigation; security sync; Oscar voice download), camera (only if you enable
        recording), microphone (only if you enable «Hey Oscar»; audio goes to your device's speech recognizer, the app receives text only and never
        records or uploads audio). No contacts or SMS permissions.</li>
      <li><strong>In-app navigation (Google Navigation SDK):</strong> when you request directions, your location and destination are sent to Google to
        compute the route, under <a class="text-indigo-700 underline" href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">Google's Privacy Policy</a>.</li>
      <li><strong>Voice commands</strong> go to your device's speech-recognition app; Oscar Drive receives text only.
        <strong>The emergency button</strong> opens your messaging/share app with a location link after you confirm — you press send.</li>
      <li>The app is intended for adult drivers and is not directed at children.</li>
      <li>Contact: <a class="text-indigo-700 underline" href="mailto:contact@oscardevs.com">contact@oscardevs.com</a></li>
    </ul>
  </div>
